### 解题思路
n = n * (n+1) 递归会使n越来越多，不停地创建n下去
否则就使n变少
规则：n的值： n^(n+1)

### 代码

```csharp
public class Solution {
    public int PredictTheWinner(int n)
        {
            return Helper(n);
        }

        private int Helper(int n)
        {
            if (n == 1)
            {
                return n;
            }

            int left = n * Helper(n - 1);
            int right = Helper(n - 1);
            return left - right;
        }
}
